                        <div class="control-group" style="margin-bottom: -20px;">
                            <label class="">
                                <div><sup>1</sup><small>Mandatory field</small></div>
                                <div><sup>2</sup><small>Needed for filament usage prediction</small></div>
                                <div><sup>3</sup><small>See <a href="https://icezaza2543.github.io/SpoolmanDB-Community/" target="newTab">https://icezaza2543.github.io/SpoolmanDB-Community/ (without warranty)</a></small></div>
